       fact_pattern = 'Paul owned a narrow riverfront parcel where he kept beehives for the honey cakes his family sold each Advent season. During a family potluck, Paul signed a deed that described the parcel and used words of present conveyance, but the space for the grantee’s name was empty. Paul handed the paper to Martha and asked her to keep it with his private papers. He did not authorize Martha to fill in any name. After Paul died, Martha typed her own name into the blank space and recorded the instrument.',
