       fact_pattern = 'Timothy works the evening shift in the shipping room at Manna Games, a private company that sells Bible-themed board games and collector study-Bible sets. On Monday night, Barnabas, a collector with a reputation for using hired muscle, sends Timothy a video message from a retreat center three states away:

