nd the other says reliance.","authority":null,"last_minute_review":true}],"drill_seeds":[{"drill_type":"timeline_clash","target_skill":"CLASH","prompt":"Replacement hired December 5; outside commitment released December 12. Which date controls?","answer":"December 5 controls because reliance came before cure."},{"drill_type":"label_vs_fact","target_skill":"Issue-Sense","prompt":"One answer says ''repudiation''; another says ''hired replacement in reliance.'' Which is stronger?","answer":"The reliance answer."},{"drill_type":"wrong_timing_cut","target_skill":"CUT","prompt":"A performer is ready on the start date after the company already hired a replacement. What is the trap?","answer":"Later readiness."},{"drill_type":"notice_lure","target_skill":"CUT","prompt":"The performer never personally warned the company, but the company learned from a reliable notice. What is the trap?","answer":"Direct-notice wrong element."}],"updated_copy_source":"C:/FOC/Workspace/Finished/*_updated.md"}'
