       why_wrong_or_correct = 'B is correct. Daniel is the person Ruth sued. The answer must explain why Daniel’s estate is or is not responsible for Ruth’s injury. The stem says Daniel was acting with reasonable care. That fact blocks the rescue-doctrine route against Daniel’s estate.

