       question_stem = 'Source row: BARMATRIX Q# 20627, Civil Procedure, Subject Matter Jurisdiction, Diversity — Time of Filing. The supplied row states that both parties were Maine citizens when the complaint was filed, the defendant later moved before responding, and the correct answer is no diversity jurisdiction because citizenship is determined at filing. 

