       why_attractive = NULL,
       why_wrong_or_correct = 'D is correct. The facts point to a nuisance remedy that fixes the interference without overcorrecting. The blower’s odor and rumble substantially interfere with the cottages, so “no remedy” is too severe. But Barnabas has shown a moderate-cost fix that will end nearly all of the problem without shutting down the business, so total closure is too severe too.

